verb lens_fades "The Lens runs out of magic" by world priority 46 in beat at 440 780
  take tick_nayru
  take lens_on
  unless magic
  give link_turn

verb lens_idle "The Lens is off" by world priority 46 in beat at 580 780
  take tick_nayru
  unless lens_on
  give link_turn

verb lens_count_clears "The Lens count resets" by world priority 99 in beat at 440 850
  take lens_count
  unless lens_on
